DLC_Dat["Wrathstone"]={}
DLC_Dat["Wrathstone"].name="Wrathstone"
DLC_Dat["Wrathstone"].dat={
2260, -- Frostvault Vanquisher,  Defeat Icestalker, Warlord Tzogvin, the Vault Protector, Rizzuk Bonechill, and the Stonekeeper in Frostvault.
2261, -- Frostvault Conqueror,  Defeat Icestalker, Warlord Tzogvin, the Vault Protector, Rizzuk Bonechill, and the Stonekeeper in Veteran Frostvault.
2262, -- Vault Cracker,  Defeat the Stonekeeper after pressing the Veracity Verifier in Veteran Frostvault.
2263, -- Smash and Grab,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Icestalker, Warlord Tzogvin, the Vault Protector, Rizzuk Bonechill, and the Stonekeeper within 30 minutes of entering Veteran Frostvault. Your timer starts upon entering combat.
2264, -- Safe Keeping,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Icestalker, Warlord Tzogvin, the Vault Protector, Rizzuk Bonechill, and the Stonekeeper in Veteran Frostvault without suffering a group member death.
2266, -- Frostvault Challenger,  Complete the listed achievements for Veteran Frostvault.
2267, -- Relentless Raider,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Icestalker, Warlord Tzogvin, the Vault Protector, Rizzuk Bonechill, and the Stonekeeper after using the Veracity Verifier in Veteran Frostvault within 30 minutes without suffering a group member death. Your timer starts upon engaging the first group of enemies.
2270, -- Depths of Malatar Vanquisher,  Defeat the Scavenging Maw, the Weeping Woman, the Dark Orb, King Narilmor, and the Symphony of Blades in Depths of Malatar.
2271, -- Depths of Malatar Conqueror,  Defeat the Scavenging Maw, the Weeping Woman, the Dark Orb, King Narilmor, and the Symphony of Blades in Veteran Depths of Malatar.
2272, -- Throwing Shade,  Defeat the Symphony of Blades after destroying the Dictates of the Lady of Light in Veteran Depths of Malatar.
2273, -- The Speed of Light,  Defeat the Scavenging Maw, the Weeping Woman, the Dark Orb, King Narilmor, and the Symphony of Blades within 30 minutes of entering Veteran Depths of Malatar. Your timer starts on entering combat.
2274, -- Purified,  Defeat the Scavenging Maw, the Weeping Woman, the Dark Orb, King Narilmor, and the Symphony of Blades without suffering a group member death in Veteran Depths of Malatar.
2275, -- Depths of Malatar Challenger,  Complete the listed achievements for Veteran Depths of Malatar.
2276, -- Depths Defier,  Defeat the Scavenging Maw, the Weeping Woman, the Dark Orb, King Narilmor, and the Symphony of Blades after destroying the Dictates of the Lady of Light in Veteran Depths of Malatar within 30 minutes without suffering a group member death. Your timer starts upon engaging the first group of enemies.
2277, -- Wrathstone Delver,  Complete both Frostvault and Depths of Malatar in Veteran.
2380, -- Wild Walloping,  Cause Icestalker to uppercut its allies during Frenzied Pummeling in Frostvault.
2381, -- Running the Right Angles,  Always dodge Warlord Tzogvin's Reckless Charges in Frostvault.
2382, -- Three Sheets to the Wind,  Get Warlord Tzogvin to destroy all three of his banners with Raging Winds in Frostvault.
2384, -- Cold Potato,  Defeat Rizzuk and Avalanche in Frostvault with each party member having been affected by Avalanche's Glacial Prison ability at least once during the fight in Veteran Frostvault.
2385, -- Drop Testing,  Knock 20 enemies off the Stonekeeper's platform in Frostvault.
2386, -- A Variety of Vermin,  Take control of each type of custom skeevaton. Custom skeevatons are available during an Extermination Protocol phase of the Stonekeeper battle after having activated the Veracity Verifier in Veteran Frostvault. You cannot be Scrap Metal or dead at the end of the phase to receive credit.
2387, -- Rat Race,  Shut down the Stonekeeper's Extermination Protocol using Tharayya's skeevatons within 35 seconds of her summoning them in Frostvault. Timer begins at the start of her warning.
2388, -- Hide and Seek,  Don't allow any of the Scavenging Maw's Hunting Proboscis to be shattered and don't get hit by any of its shadow forms in Veteran Depths of Malatar.
2389, -- Skating the Ice,  Have no group members get hit by Glaciation during your battle with the Weeping Woman in Veteran Depths of Malatar.
2390, -- Color Blind,  Don't destroy any colored orbs during the Dark Orb encounter in Veteran Depths of Malatar.
2391, -- Soul Mates,  Prevent Quintus from ever winning his deadlock with Tharayya during the battle with King Narilmor in Depths of Malatar.
2392, -- Reaping Rainbow,  Defeat each color of Auroran during the battle with the Symphony of Blades in Depths of Malatar.
2393, -- Out of Formation,  Prevent the Symphony of Blades from crossing the Auroran Phalanx and becoming empowered by Meridia's Light in Veteran Depths of Malatar.
2395, -- Lackluster,  After reading the Dictate to the Lady of Light, enter the colored room without leaving any colored orbs alive during the Symphony of Blades encounter in Veteran Depths of Malatar.
2471, -- Wrathstone Scout,  Complete both Frostvault and Depths of Malatar in Normal.
}
